#: ../../source/docs/common-blackboxlogger.rst:5
#: 6b8da2254e8e410f955f4b41cd7b2e70
msgid "Plane BlackBox Logger using ArduPilot"
msgstr "使用 ArduPilot 的 Plane 黑匣子记录器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blackboxlogger.rst:7
#: bc04437b48b748b69c4560fc859ad229
msgid ""
"BlackBox loggers are commonly used to capture aircraft position, attitude, "
"and speed information on aircraft without an autopilot. Using an autopilot "
"and GPS, an a custom version of ArduPilot Plane firmware, such a logger can "
"be implemented. Compass is not required, and usually not recommended, or at "
"least disabled, due to possible magnetic interference since the logger "
"position may be close to power wiring in the vehicle."
msgstr ""
"黑匣子记录器通常用于记录无飞控飞机的位置、姿态和速度信息。使用飞控、GPS 和定制版本的 ArduPilot Plane "
"固件，可以实现这样的记录器。不需要罗盘，通常不建议使用罗盘或至少禁用它，因为记录器可能靠近飞行器电源线，存在磁干扰。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blackboxlogger.rst:10
#: cf743afdb9a240b1816586a0bce1b5b9
msgid ""
"The firmware can be obtained for any ArduPilot supported autopilot by using "
"the `Custom Firmware Build Server <https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__."
msgstr ""
"可以通过 `自定义固件构建服务器 <https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__ 为任何 ArduPilot 支持的飞控获取固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blackboxlogger.rst:12
#: 785db734b60844f28df1bdefdeea04b1
msgid ""
"The default options for the autopilot can be left enabled, and just the "
"enable the Plane:blackbox logging check box and build and then flash to the "
"autopilot."
msgstr "飞控的默认选项可以保持启用状态，只需勾选 Plane:blackbox logging 选项，然后构建并烧录到飞控即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blackboxlogger.rst:16
#: 746e17c078054989bb23ae3f39e27e08
msgid ""
"The GPS should be configured, and all the normal setup calibrations should "
"be done as if it were a normal plane autopilot. However, it will not have "
"any outputs functions, or servos/motors attached. It merely \"rides along\" "
"to record information."
msgstr ""
"应配置 GPS，并像正常 Plane 飞控一样完成所有常规设置校准。但它不会有任何输出功能，也不会连接舵机/电机。它仅作为「搭乘者」记录信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blackboxlogger.rst:18
#: becdc26c5fbf47ac82bdbebb8c8c2b86
msgid ""
"In order to function properly, it will need to auto arm itself in the air."
msgstr "为了正常工作，需要在空中自动解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blackboxlogger.rst:20
#: 958b7af945e54c14a1ebfc9b39d3d003
msgid ""
"The ``BBOX_SPD`` parameter should be set to a speed in meters/second when "
"the arming will occur after the vehicle is launched and flying, . Default is"
" 5m/s."
msgstr "``BBOX_SPD`` 参数应设置为解锁时的速度（米/秒），在飞行器起飞并飞行后达到此速度时解锁。默认值为 5m/s。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blackboxlogger.rst:22
#: 21b6b3ebb84f473c81b1484ffeca2d8d
msgid ""
"Logs collected can be downloaded from the SD card after the flight. See "
":ref:`common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner`."
msgstr ""
"飞行后可从 SD 卡下载收集的日志。参见 :ref:`common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-"
"mission-planner`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blackboxlogger.rst:24
#: 929e7ddb829a404695ab161a5e182a81
msgid ""
"while not required, it is possible to route the aircraft's power system "
"through the autopilot's power monitor, if one is attached, to log current "
"and voltage also. Likewise, an airspeed sensor could be attached to the "
"logger to record actual airspeed instead of only ground speed. Estimated "
"airspeed and wind speed will be logged, even if no airspeed sensor is used."
msgstr ""
"虽然不是必须的，但如果连接了电源监测器，可以将飞行器的电源系统接入飞控的电源监测器，同时记录电流和电压。同样，可以为记录器连接空速传感器，以记录实际空速而非仅记录地速。即使不使用空速传感器，也会记录估算的空速和风速。"
